        <p>This patent describes an ultra-low phase noise frequency synthesizer that uses a dual loop design comprising a main PLL and a sampling PLL, combined with DDS and Fractional-N PLL techniques. The design addresses phase noise limitations in communication systems.</p>
        <p>&nbsp;<a href="https://patents.google.com/patent/US9660655" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="official-record-link">Official Record &#x2197;</a></p>
      </article>

      <article class="patent-entry">
